loading_tips = PackedStringArray("A Cowpoke squares up and a glint flashes at its hip before it draws: break line of sight or shoot it first. A headshot spoils the draw.", "Prospectors dig in and tunnel toward you. When the dust ring grows under your feet, step out of it.", "The saloon balcony is high ground with a long view up Main Street: the stairs come up from the alley south of the saloon.", "The livery barn is open at both ends and the saloon has a back door: cut through them to lose a crowd.", "In the dust storm you can't see far. Listen for the spurs, and keep your back to a wall.", "Sheriff Rattlebones throws dynamite where you stand: keep moving, and never stand in his charge lane.")
